# QA ROB-1: data load failures must show an error and return to the menu, never panic. Run with
# --assets-dir target/qa/broken-assets (a copy of assets/ with data/tracks/toy_town.ron truncated
# to 2000 bytes and `radius: "big"` in data/items.ron).
wait ui
wait screen title                  # the splash ends after its fade (frame clock)
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
1.5 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left             # Toy Town (broken track + broken items)
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 nav keyboardA confirm          # race
3.0 shot le_01_toy_town_error
2.0 shot le_02_toy_town_error_later
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # dismiss
2.0 shot le_03_after_dismiss
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # (wherever we are) try Sofa Circuit: broken items only
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Sofa Circuit
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 nav keyboardA confirm          # race
3.0 shot le_04_sofa_error
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 shot le_05_end
1.0 exit
